{"The `shutdown` method and `ShutDown` exception used in `FixedQueuePool` and `OrderedQueueWorker` are not part of the standard `queue.Queue`, causing an `AttributeError` during shutdown and preventing worker threads from terminating gracefully. Should import `queue` from `arroyo` instead.": 0.9070568680763245, "Test assertion appears incorrect - `OrderedQueueWorker` calls `complete_offset` in a `finally` block, meaning offset is marked complete even if `result_processor` raises an exception. After processing offset 100 (fails) and 101 (succeeds), both should be complete and offset should be committed, but test expects no commit.": 0.7594037055969238}